msgstr "**已归档** .. note::"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:13
#: 39e9d8744ece4e0c91ddc74a18af8a9f
msgid ""
"The SPEED_TURN parameters are used to set the percentage reduction in "
"throttle when turning around a waypoint and the distance before a target "
"when the Rover will start to slow down."
msgstr "SPEED_TURN 参数用于设置绕航点转弯时油门降低的百分比，以及 Rover 在目标点前开始减速的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:17
#: 018d6e2a8159467093396cab9058c853
msgid "The two parameters are listed below:"
msgstr "两个参数如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:19
#: d1d6bd021ce44aa188044a828aebb989
msgid "``SPEED_TURN_GAIN``"
msgstr "``SPEED_TURN_GAIN``"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:21
#: 6d26b9cab75644be967b40e3eb185e8a
msgid "Range 0-100 Units: percent Increment 1 (50)"
msgstr "范围 0-100 单位：百分比 增量 1（50）"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:22
#: 7b7b91a013d9409b856a7e8e1a7fadcb
msgid ""
"The percentage to reduce the throttle while turning. If this is 100% then "
"the target speed is not reduced while turning. If this is 50% then the "
"target speed is reduced in proportion to the turn rate, with a reduction of "
"50% when the steering is maximally deflected."
msgstr "转弯时油门降低的百分比。若设为100%，则转弯时目标速度不降低。若设为50%，目标速度与转弯速率成比例降低，方向舵最大偏转时降低50%。"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:27
#: 0e4ccdd20b554921b4c346d8f465d088
msgid "``SPEED_TURN_DIST``"
msgstr "``SPEED_TURN_DIST``"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:29
#: 62f82bdf1bbf48f5a103fbfca1ea3efc
msgid "Range 0-100 Units: meters Increment .1 (50)"
msgstr "范围 0-100 单位：米 增量 0.1（50）"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:30
#: d958598acec54bc59a515d618e47fb4b
msgid ""
"The distance to the next turn at which the rover reduces its target speed by"
" the SPEED_TURN_GAIN."
"                                                                                                                                                                          "
"|"
msgstr "到下一转弯点的距离，Rover 将在此距离处按 SPEED_TURN_GAIN 的比例降低目标速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:34
#: 867e95a3f56d47e19c66251e1757a45f
msgid ""
"The parameters are set in the *Mission Planner* **CONFIG/TUNING \\| Basic "
"Tuning** page:"
msgstr "参数在 *Mission Planner* **配置/调试 \\| 基础调试** 页面中设置："

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:40
#: 5e5e7328a8004efdbc35855d54e33438
msgid "Mission Planner: Rover BasicTuning"
msgstr "Mission Planner：Rover 基础调试"

#: ../../source/docs/speed-turn-parameter-tuning.rst:44
#: 9cae4f7bc9e44786a5f79c92e3660069
msgid ""
"All parameters may be adjusted in the \"Advanced Parameter List\" in Mission"
" Planner). All the Rover user settable parameters are listed in :doc:`Rover "
"Parameters <parameters>`."
msgstr ""
"所有参数均可在 Mission Planner 的「高级参数列表」中调整。所有 Rover 用户可设置的参数均列于 :doc:`Rover 参数 "
"<parameters>` 中。"
